=== yt issue list ===
List issues matching a YouTrack query

Usage: yt issue list [FLAGS] [QUERY]…

Arguments:
  [QUERY]…  YouTrack search query, e.g. `for: me #Unresolved`

Flags:
      --query <QUERY>      YouTrack search query, instead of QUERY
  -p, --project <PROJECT>  Only issues of this project
  -n, --limit <LIMIT>      How many issues to show
                           (default: 50)
      --all                Show every matching issue
  -h, --help               Print help

Global flags:
      --profile <PROFILE>  Profile to use [env: YT_PROFILE]
      --format <FORMAT>    Output format (default: table) [env: YT_FORMAT]
                           [possible values: table, json, ndjson]
  -v, --verbose            More log output: -v for debug, -vv for trace
  -q, --quiet              Only print errors
      --no-color           Disable color
      --no-input           Fail instead of prompting [env: YT_NO_INPUT]
  -y, --yes                Confirm destructive actions without asking

